  /Volumes/4/GitHub/the-catch-site-wt-jobs-sept/src/pages/events/jobs/2026-10-02-september-payrolls-rise-29000.astro:115: USA Today headlined the release &ldquo;September jobs report shows slowdown in hiring, unemployment ticks up&rdquo;. The {jobs(septemberPayrollChange * 1000)} is a net change in payroll jobs, not a count of hires, and it is under about {jobs(establishment.significanceThreshold * 1000)}, the monthly change the bureau says is statistically significant. Hires, &ldquo;all additions to the payroll&rdquo; during the month, are counted in a separate survey.
